WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.280 --> 00:00:02.523
One fine day, a greedy dog took a walk.

2
00:00:36.652 --> 00:00:38.072
He saw something in the grass.

3
00:00:38.092 --> 00:00:41.173
"Oh! It's a bone!

4
00:00:41.953 --> 00:00:42.674
I love bones!"

5
00:00:43.034 --> 00:00:43.514
he said.

6
00:00:47.275 --> 00:00:47.995
a lucky day!

7
00:00:48.535 --> 00:00:49.495
Lucky day, lucky day!"

8
00:00:55.957 --> 00:00:57.238
How will I cook my new bone?"

9
00:00:57.558 --> 00:00:58.038
he said.

10
00:01:02.479 --> 00:01:02.879
I smoke it?

11
00:01:03.819 --> 00:01:06.280
No! Will I boil it?

12
00:01:06.836 --> 00:01:09.317
No! Will I fry it?

13
00:01:10.098 --> 00:01:11.118
No way!

14
00:01:14.700 --> 00:01:16.201
I will eat it as it is.

15
00:01:19.443 --> 00:01:21.344
That is the best way to eat a delicious bone.

16
00:01:24.045 --> 00:01:25.046
Lu-lu la-la!

17
00:01:25.126 --> 00:01:26.006
Lu-lu la-la!"

18
00:01:26.386 --> 00:01:28.147
He danced.

19
00:01:28.167 --> 00:01:32.870
"Oh, what if another dog sees me?"

20
00:01:33.190 --> 00:01:33.730
he said.

21
00:01:33.750 --> 00:01:39.153
"No, I will not, I will not share my bone.

22
00:01:39.854 --> 00:01:41.055
It is all mine!

23
00:01:41.075 --> 00:01:43.496
Hmm, where can I hide my bone?"

24
00:01:45.437 --> 00:01:47.698
He looked around and quickly left the park.

25
00:01:51.420 --> 00:01:52.501
He ran and ran.

26
00:01:54.622 --> 00:01:56.603
Finally, he ran onto a bridge.

27
00:01:56.623 --> 00:02:00.206
"Whew! Now my bone is safe," he thought.

28
00:02:02.287 --> 00:02:04.148
The greedy dog was very tired.

29
00:02:05.256 --> 00:02:06.698
So he rested on the bridge.

30
00:02:09.060 --> 00:02:10.702
He looked down into the stream.

31
00:02:15.186 --> 00:02:16.047
Who is that?"

32
00:02:16.428 --> 00:02:16.928
he thought.

33
00:02:16.948 --> 00:02:21.293
"That dog has a bone too.

34
00:02:21.313 --> 00:02:25.037
Hmm, his bone is bigger than mine.

35
00:02:26.038 --> 00:02:27.799
And his bone still has meat on it!"

36
00:02:32.588 --> 00:02:34.991
The greedy dog wanted the other bone too.

37
00:02:35.011 --> 00:02:37.453
"Woof! Woof!

38
00:02:37.633 --> 00:02:38.774
Give me that bone!"

39
00:02:39.115 --> 00:02:39.595
he said.

40
00:02:44.160 --> 00:02:44.660
my bone!

41
00:02:44.961 --> 00:02:45.561
It is gone!

42
00:02:45.581 --> 00:02:48.504
Woof! Woof!"

43
00:02:49.325 --> 00:02:50.326
But it was too late.

44
00:02:51.547 --> 00:02:53.850
His bone fell into the deep stream.
